  "body": "Red Beach | Professionals \r\n\r\n**Professionals Real Estate looks forward to welcoming you home.**\r\n\r\nCoastal living takes centre stage with this impressive house and land package, offering a spacious two-storey design and the option of including a private inground pool. With four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a generous 280sqm floor plan, this is a home designed to make the most of relaxed family living entertaining. \r\n\r\n**Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.**\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across two levels, this home combines generous proportions with a relaxed coastal feel. The open plan living spaces are positioned to capture the outlook, while the pool creates the perfect setting for summer entertaining and family enjoyment. With flexible layout and quality new-build appeal, this is an opportunity to secure a substantial home in one of Hibiscus Coasts most sought-after locations. \r\n\r\nThe current design features:\r\n* Four spacious bedrooms plus 3.5 bathrooms\r\n* Option to have the living area as a formal lounge or additional bedroom on the ground floor\r\n* Generous 280sqm approx two-storey floorplan \r\n* Option of a heated inground pool for effortless summer living\r\n* Option of including a lift\r\n* 10-year Master Build Guarantee for peace of mind \r\n* The last remaining section in this boutique cul-de-sac. \r\n* Turnkey or staged deposit available\r\n\r\n**Do you need to sell in order to purchase? There may be some flexibility with this listing - get in touch to discuss options.**\r\n\r\nDesigned with modern family living in mind, the home offers plenty of space to spread out while maintaining a strong connection between indoor and outdoors. Whether you're entertaining friends beside the pool, enjoying the outlook or simply relaxing at home, the combination of scale, views and lifestyle makes this a property with genuine wow factor. \r\n\r\n**Buying an investment? Purchase this home and receive 3 months of free property management from our award winning team.**\r\n\r\nRed Beach is a popular coastal community offering enviable lifestyle with beaches, parks, walking tracks, local shops, cafes and everyday amenities all close by. The area is well connected to Orewa, Silverdale and the wider Hibiscus Coast, while nearby schooling and recreational facilities add an extra appeal for families. Just stroll along the estuary walkway to Kingsway Junior, Senior or Silverdale Primary or the locally zoned Orewa College. \r\n\r\nThis house and land package is an exciting opportunity to secure a brand-new coastal home in this sought after enclave of homes. If this design doesn't work, get in touch to customise the layout to suit your requirements. Note: pool is optional. Final price will depend on the final agreed plans, specifications and finishes. \r\n\r\nContact Sarah today for further information, specifications and details on how to secure this property. \r\n\r\n**Experienced. Trusted. Consistent. Local Professionals.**\r\n\r\n**We believe real estate should be done better. Higher standards, clear communication, and proven systems are the reason our clients trust us to deliver, time and time again.**\r\n\r\n**If you are buying, selling, or looking for a better way to manage property, we would love to help. Backed by Meros Group, delivering a complete property solution - Sales, Rentals, Home Staging and Concierge.**\r\n\r\n**It's time for higher standards.**",
